      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00042",
        "explanation": "When the family reports seeing the Holter headlines, the doctor asks for verbatim text and gives a targeted list of high‑risk words to search for, and then interprets the actual readings against the clinical context of a postural syncope episode.",
        "quote": "你把你现在手机上能看到的那几行原文逐字发给我，尤其是这些部分：1. 报告结论/提示 2. 心率范围"
