        "explanation": "The doctor intentionally recovers the child’s age, the precise episode details (morning, standing, not during exercise), and the discharge context, and then uses that information across all follow‑up turns.",
        "quote": "孩子现在大概几岁？这次晕倒前是在站着、起身、运动，还是洗澡时发生的？大概晕了多久？出院小结上有没有写复诊科室、复诊时间"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00088",
        "explanation": "The doctor identifies that the reported Holter findings (偶发房早、偶发室早) are not the dangerous patterns, and explicitly names the words that would require immediate escalation.",
        "quote": "长时间停搏\n- 室性心动过速/室速\n- 高度房室传导阻滞\n- 严重心动过缓\n- 明显异常心律并提示与晕厥相关"
      }
    ],
